The '''Magma Chamber''' is a [[Location]] on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}. The [[Magma Boss]] will spawn there some time after it's killed.

{{ZoneText|Watch out for fireballs!|Fight the Magma Cube Boss.|Beware of lava.}}

== Location ==
The '''Magma Chamber''' is located under the [[Blazing Volcano]] and it has many lava pools with one main lava pool where the boss loot spawns and the boss reforms in the middle. You can access {{Zone|Aura's Lab}}, Quartz Caverns and [[The Matriarch]] from the lava platforms.

